name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q5_2026-pilot'

question 'A student and an AI co-create a short story. The student provides the main idea, edits the AI\'s draft, and rewrites key sections. Which statement best describes this situation?'

wrong 'The student should get no credit because the AI did all the writing.'
right 'This is an example of responsible co-creation where the human maintains creative control.'
wrong 'The AI deserves more credit because it wrote more words than the student.'
wrong 'Co-creation with AI is never appropriate for school assignments.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

